# Netlify and Cloudflare Pages read this file; S3 + CloudFront does not, and
# ignores it harmlessly — there the same rule is the viewer-request function in
# DEPLOY.md.
#
# www is the canonical host: every canonical tag in the HTML points at it, so
# the apex redirects to www and not the other way round. `301!` forces the
# redirect even when a file exists at the path.
https://chrisneddys.com/*  https://www.chrisneddys.com/:splat  301!
